# Copy this file to .env in this folder and fill in the token. .env is listed in .gitignore; this template is tracked.
# T3 uses Qwen3.5-4B and bge-large-en-v1.5, which download from the Hugging Face Hub without a token, so the line can
# stay empty. A read token (https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens) is needed only to run a gated model in its place.
# Never paste it into a notebook.
HF_TOKEN=
